## Suggested reviews

{% set flagged = r.concentration | selectattr("flagged") | list %}
{% for c in flagged %}
- **{{ c.ticker }}** is {{ c.weight | pct }} of the portfolio — above the {{ r.concentration_threshold | pct }} concentration threshold; consider trimming.
{% endfor %}
{% for e in r.review_events %}
{% set d = e.details %}
{% if e.event_type == "intrinsic_value_crossed_price" and d.get("direction") == "above_price" %}
- **{{ e.ticker }}**: intrinsic value crossed above price ({{ d.get("intrinsic_value") | money }} vs {{ d.get("price") | money }}, was {{ d.get("prev_intrinsic_value") | money }} vs {{ d.get("prev_price") | money }}) — potentially undervalued again; review whether to add.
{% elif e.event_type == "intrinsic_value_crossed_price" and d.get("direction") == "below_price" %}
- **{{ e.ticker }}**: intrinsic value crossed below price ({{ d.get("intrinsic_value") | money }} vs {{ d.get("price") | money }}, was {{ d.get("prev_intrinsic_value") | money }} vs {{ d.get("prev_price") | money }}) — potentially overvalued; review whether to trim.
{% elif e.event_type == "intrinsic_value_crossed_price" %}
- **{{ e.ticker }}**: intrinsic value crossed price ({{ d.get("intrinsic_value") | money }} vs {{ d.get("price") | money }}, was {{ d.get("prev_intrinsic_value") | money }} vs {{ d.get("prev_price") | money }}) — review the valuation.
{% elif e.event_type == "new_red_flag" %}
- **{{ e.ticker }}**: new red narrative flag `{{ d.get("flag", "—") }}` ({{ d.get("reason", "—") }}) — re-read the story before trusting the valuation.
{% elif e.event_type == "below_quality_gate" %}
- **{{ e.ticker }}**: newly fails quality gate `{{ d.get("gate", "—") }}` — review whether the thesis survives it.
{% elif e.event_type == "sector_recalibrated" %}
- **{{ e.ticker }}**: sector WACC moved {{ d.get("delta") | bps }} ({{ d.get("prev_wacc") | pct }} → {{ d.get("wacc") | pct }}) — re-check the margin of safety under the new discount rate.
{% elif e.event_type == "new_filing" %}
- **{{ e.ticker }}**: new {{ d.get("filing_type", "—") }} filed {{ d.get("filing_date", "—") }} — read it and refresh the analysis with `bot analyze {{ e.ticker }}`.
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
